  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Kanchipuram.\u00a0Dayalan 2019 asserts, without argument or mention of Kanchipuram, a tentative alternative identification with Mamallapuram.\u00a0Nannam 2019 uncritically resurrects an early 20th century identification with Krishnapatna/Gandagopalapattana port.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Ptolemy places this ancient city in India. BAtlas identifies it firmly with modern Kanchipuram, which is located inland and southwest from modern Chennai.",
